SLACKBUILDS-OVERLAY

Local SlackBuild overrides for Slackware-current.
Not suitable for upstream submission.

WHY

Kept here either for my custom config.h, or because the SlackBuilds.org
version uses an older release or different patches than what I run.
Full SlackBuilds are kept (not just config.h) so each is rebuildable.

